    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf931ef83c871eba2a93e5d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但『我，尚未达到木鸡的境界』。\r\n我没法消除，对不争气的自己的愤怒。\r\n（「木鸡」典故出自《庄子》，指不受外物牵制的心境）",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eb08afcf7c9543cd3a44b0aa619d7557d64bd316a6ccd7d8ac4d3347a13a2a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
