    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56178916f73666072a9516cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我遵从自己的意志，决定了要跑步。我所要走到极致的\r\n道路，就在跑道之上。我会不停下脚步继续跑下去，\r\n直到到达顶点为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d97c8fef613080a572d325c47068171931fb84601cd391a465b8ecbdc0b6df5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
