    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d392970a4b92192f35c2a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那样的话……无论什么时候，我都不会让出胜利。\r\n……无论什么时候，发生了什么事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "267f689701c697864404df4dc7f931b397ecec629f4dabe83924884d8aefadd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
